      "message": "I still don\u0027t get this: isn\u0027t \u0027borrow\u0027 fully wiped out in every two iterations - it is a 64 bit value each cycle shifted by 32 bits.\n\nI.e. if the difference is more than two digits away from the MSB, it will be lost?",
